    {
      "id": "swcwxez",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Non‑Communicable Diseases"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "15yltoq",
      "content": "• Diabetes – High blood sugar levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Vaccination is the most effective method of preventing infectious diseases and building long-term active immunity.",
      "id": "zh2rswp"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xtuj7dj",
      "content": "• Hypertension – High blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hgqlqzc",
      "content": "• Cancer – Uncontrolled cell division."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bv27f0k",
      "content": "• Heart disease – Affects heart function."
    },
    {
